WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to newly-developed
technology,

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.436 size:84% position:42%
we here at "Late Night"
now have the ability

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.205 line:92%
to re-cord -- to record...

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:06.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
Re-cord.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:11.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
To re-cord --
the act of recording.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:14.381 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:15.081 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:19.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
...the tiny voice -- Please.
No, I don't...

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:22.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't treat me like
a sweetheart candy.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:25.258 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.359 line:92%
[ Laughing ] And finally --

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, it records
the tiny voice

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is inside
Donald Trump's head.

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:32.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you might be surprised
to know that,

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:33.867 line:92%
like everyone's inner voice,

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:37.971
Donald Trump's is filled with
paralyzing fear and self doubt,

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:38.805 size:84% position:42% line:92%
so here is, once again,

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:42.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
the tiny voice in the back
of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:47.280 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.681 line:92%
-Perhaps you could tell them...

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:52.152
-Hey, Donald, it's the tiny
voice in the back of your head,

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:54.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I know today is about
border security,

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:57.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
but don't you think
you should say something

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.192 size:84% position:42% line:92%
about Ted Cruz's beard?

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:03.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ted Cruz's beard is a threat
to all Americans.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.098 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It is such a bad beard.

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:08.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
It looks as though
he put glue on his face

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
and rolled around
on a barbershop floor.

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:11.971 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:16.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
It looks like Wolverine
if he didn't have any powers,

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:20.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
although you probably
shouldn't talk.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:20.980 line:92%
Your windbreaker's so open,

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:24.217 size:81% position:41%
it looks like you're
wearing a lobster bib.

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:28.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is not a good-looking
group of people.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:31.458 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

